        "en": "Deals Physical DMG equal to #1[i]% of Clara's ATK to all enemies, and additionally deals Physical DMG equal to #2[i]% of Clara's ATK to enemies marked by Svarog with a Mark of Counter.\nAll Marks of Counter will be removed after this Skill is used.",
